  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ao/171/2023 on 9 August, 2023",
    "facts": "The aforesaid written instruction(s) received from the authorized signatory of the appellant-Adani Wilmar Limited are kept with the records.",
    "arguments": "3. Learned counsel for the appellant would submit that this is the appeal against the judgment and order dated 24.12.2022 passed by Food Safety Appellate Tribunal, Dehradun whereby the appeals filed by the appellant against the order of the Adjudicatory Officer have been dismissed. He would submit that there is a delay of 68 days in filing the present appeal; that, as per Section 71(6) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, the period of limitation is 60 days and; that, the delay has occurred on account of the fact that the judgment passed by the Tribunal on 24.12.2022 was communicated to the appellant on 03.04.2023. 4. Per contra, learned counsel for the State would submit that as per Section 76 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 before hearing on any of the application, the proposed appellant has to deposit the entire amount of penalty imposed.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. Learned counsel for the appellant would submit that this is the appeal against the judgment and order dated 24.12.2022 passed by Food Safety Appellate Tribunal, Dehradun whereby the appeals filed by the appellant against the order of the Adjudicatory Officer have been dismissed. He would submit that there is a delay of 68 days in filing the present appeal; that, as per Section 71(6) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, the period of limitation is 60 days and; that, the delay has occurred on account of the fact that the judgment passed by the Tribunal on 24.12.2022 was communicated to the appellant on 03.04.2023. 4. Per contra, learned counsel for the State would submit that as per Section 76 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 before hearing on any of the application, the proposed appellant has to deposit the entire amount of penalty imposed.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
